{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13204140","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13204140","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:4:1320414001:0":{"text":"마스터, 게르다 부인! 탐지기가 반응해요!","source_cn":"主人，格尔达女士！探测器响了！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x62552C7F7693B70B","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"마스터, 게르다 부인! 탐지기가 반응해요!","female":"마스터, 게르다 부인! 탐지기가 반응해요!","variant_male_record_index":"145506","variant_female_record_index":"145507","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320414002:0":{"text":"어라... 소리가 왜 났다가 끊기죠? 화면에 나타나는 온도차도 왔다 갔다 하네요.","source_cn":"咦……它的响声怎么断断续续的？显示屏上的温差也时有时无。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C7F42BC1BB1DEAF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320414003:0":{"text":"이상하네요. 온천과 주변 온도차는 일정해야 하는데, 이렇게 변할 리가 없잖아요.","source_cn":"真奇怪，温泉和附近的温差应该是恒定的，不可能这样变来变去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xADCC664EBEAE6816","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320414004:1":{"text":"설마 탐지기가 정확하지 않은 걸까요?","source_cn":"难不成是探测器不够准确？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9092D8C84D54B4DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1320414004":{"text":"설마 탐지기가 정확하지 않은 걸까요?","source_cn":"难不成是探测器不够准确？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9092D8C84D54B4DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant